Kount A1 — the collection dialog's External ID is shown and editable in the admin console.

At this web vault the field was read-only and shown only for a collection that already had an External ID
(`isExternalIdVisible = isAdminConsoleActive && !!externalId`), so an admin could not type the id Kount Protect
gives an account (plan DA, A1; docs/spike-2026-11.md E14). The admin console's two dialog openers (add and edit)
pass `isAdminConsoleActive: true`; outside the admin console the field stays hidden. The value is trimmed on
save (the server stores it as typed). The server already stores `externalId` on create and on update.

